    "detailed_description": "<strong>You're a computer virus, tasked with the job of taking over different machines. Use the data collected to improve your ability to take over by upgrading your arsenal of abilities!</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/7c6ee810f25fc3621425f3ef74b39f00.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/7b8e6e9383864ec2f82304d8916d3f5f.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br>Put your platforming skills to the test with fun, but difficult level design that allows beginners enjoy the game, but also give more experienced players a much more difficult challenge!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/1ab380beb998b86519bd17689a7bdbf5.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/2884059c5e0d578580147e25da18f3fb.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br>Go up against different types of anti-viruses! Just because one of them may be weak, don't let your guard down!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/e140b4b52f97c71c1f39bdf8862c0edf.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/22f0cb4255ef80a5d8e160823bffc31b.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br>Take the data you collect from each system to upgrade your virus, ranging from different ways to attack, ways to move around faster, or even upgrade how tough your virus is!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1965790/extras/b0708a8ce4d292c528611c8a7a4f8292.avif?t=1744845117\" /></div><br>Learn more about your creator, why he created you, and what their true intensions are!",
